WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:02.904 line:86%
Now I'll show the second tool

00:00:02.944 --> 00:00:03.672 line:86%
in Vizai.

00:00:03.712 --> 00:00:05.300 line:86%
With it you can take

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.117 line:86%
that texture from your supplier

00:00:07.157 --> 00:00:09.168 line:86%
and turn it into a seamless texture.

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:10.130 line:86%
And the best part

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.233 line:86%
is that you can adjust everything,

00:00:12.273 --> 00:00:13.786 line:86%
from the size to the grout

00:00:13.826 --> 00:00:14.960 line:86%
and other details.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.376 line:86%
For this example,

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:17.870 line:86%
I'll go to the Portobello

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.723 line:86%
website and download 4 textures

00:00:19.763 --> 00:00:20.380 line:86%
of the same

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.288 line:86%
porcelain tile.

00:00:21.328 --> 00:00:23.224 line:86%
Each image has small variations,

00:00:23.264 --> 00:00:25.100 line:86%
and that makes the texture look

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:26.060 line:86%
much more realistic.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:26.959 line:86%
And of course,

00:00:26.999 --> 00:00:28.757 line:86%
you can also upload just one

00:00:28.797 --> 00:00:30.041 line:86%
image to the plugin,

00:00:30.081 --> 00:00:30.980 line:86%
if you prefer.

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:10.244 line:86%
Applied the texture to

00:01:10.284 --> 00:01:12.003 line:86%
your project and still need some

00:01:12.043 --> 00:01:12.730 line:86%
adjustments?

00:01:12.770 --> 00:01:13.908 line:86%
Just select the texture

00:01:13.948 --> 00:01:15.791 line:86%
in SketchUp and come back to adjust

00:01:15.831 --> 00:01:17.220 line:86%
everything in the plugin.

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:18.831 line:86%
And remember,

00:01:18.871 --> 00:01:21.272 line:86%
these tools tab features

00:01:21.312 --> 00:01:23.410 line:86%
are completely free,

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:25.230 line:86%
you can use them as much as you want,

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:26.360 line:86%
without spending any of

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:27.386 line:86%
your credits.

